Description: Classic Sudoku puzzle game for Deepin
 A classic Sudoku puzzle game with three difficulty levels
 (Easy, Medium, Hard). Features automatic puzzle generation
 with unique solutions, pencil marks, undo/redo, and a timer.
 Designed for the Deepin desktop environment.
